#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc:14
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_ShellyIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\p"
"How did you manage to get here without\n"
"a submarine?\l"
"What an impressive child!\p"
"But… It won't do to have you\n"
"meddling about here.\p"
"And, I do want payback for what\n"
"happened at the WEATHER INSTITUTE…\p"
"I'm going to give you a little taste\n"
"of pain! Resign yourself to it!$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈哈！\p"
"你没有潜水艇，\n"
"是怎么来到这里的？\l"
"真是个了不起的孩子！\p"
"不过……可不能让你\n"
"在这里碍手碍脚。\p"
"而且，天气研究所那件事，\n"
"我也想找你算账……\p"
"我要让你尝尝痛苦的滋味！\n"
"乖乖认命吧！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc:26
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_ShellyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\p"
"Ouch!$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈哈！\p"
"好痛！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_ShellyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\n"
"You're so darn strong.\p"
"It's terribly disappointing that you're\n"
"not a TEAM AQUA member.\p"
"You could have enjoyed the fabulous\n"
"world our BOSS has promised as\l"
"one of us…$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈哈！\n"
"你实在是太强了。\p"
"你不是海洋队的成员，\n"
"真是太遗憾了。\p"
"要是你成为我们的一员，\n"
"就能享受老大许诺的美好世界了……$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc:39
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_Grunt5Intro"
msgid ""
"For our dream to become real, we need\n"
"the power of POKéMON.\p"
"But meddlers like you use the power of\n"
"POKéMON to mess with us even at\l"
"a place like this!\p"
"Life just doesn't work the way we\n"
"need it to!$"
msgstr ""
"要实现我们的梦想，\n"
"就需要宝可梦的力量。\p"
"可是像你这样碍事的家伙，\n"
"却用宝可梦的力量\l"
"在这种地方也来捣乱！\p"
"人生就是不能如我们所愿啊！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_Grunt5Defeat"
msgid "Gwah!$"
msgstr "呜哇！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc:51
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_Grunt5PostBattle"
msgid ""
"You know, we don't dare question\n"
"the motives of our leader.\p"
"But here you are, just some punk,\n"
"going up against our BOSS.\p"
"Maybe…\n"
"You must be something…$"
msgstr ""
"你知道吗，我们可不敢\n"
"质疑老大的动机。\p"
"可是你，一个小毛孩，\n"
"居然要和我们老大作对。\p"
"说不定……\n"
"你真有两下子……$"
